# oracle: pouring spheres onto a plane of triangles made by fix surface/global, then turned by fix_modify move rotate, then fix_modify move none (in.tri.gran.global cut down: 30 spheres poured, 800 + 400 + 100 steps; 3d, molecule tris, wall/gran/region)
# oracle-note: stopped at step 1300 (cut-down length); the spheres reach the plane from about step 700 on. Measured: the per-atom error is 1.6e-8 at step 1400 and 4.9e-6 at step 2000 (one nearly balanced sphere; the late growth is not explained, see the report).
# oracle-inputs: w127gsg_surf.tri
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-8 abs=1e-10
# oracle-measured: max relative error (native fixture vs engine, scale max(1,|LAMMPS|)): thermo 3.6e-13, per-atom 3.8e-11 (measured with tests/fixtures/oracle, 2026-10-13)
units           lj
atom_style      sphere
boundary        f f f
dimension       3
comm_modify     vel yes

region          box block -7 7 -7 7 0 9 units box
create_box      2 box

pair_style      granular
pair_coeff      * * hooke 4000.0 100.0 &
                    tangential linear_history 1000.0 1.0 0.5 &
                    damping mass_velocity

neighbor        0.3 bin
neigh_modify    delay 0 every 1 check yes

molecule        tris w127gsg_surf.tri

fix             20 all surface/global input mol tris &
                model * * granular hooke 4000.0 100.0 &
                    tangential linear_history 1000.0 1.0 0.5 &
                    damping mass_velocity

fix             2 all nve/sphere
fix             3 all gravity 1.0 vector 0 0 -1

region          slab block -2 2 -2 2 7 9 units box
fix             ins all pour 30 1 4767548 vol 0.4 10 &
                diam one 1.0 region slab ignore

region          zcylinder cylinder z 0 0 7.0 INF INF units box
fix             wall all wall/gran/region granular hooke 4000.0 100.0 &
                         tangential linear_history 1000.0 1.0 0.5 &
                         damping mass_velocity &
                         region zcylinder

timestep        0.005

compute         1 all temp
compute_modify  1 dynamic/dof yes

compute         2 all temp/sphere
compute_modify  2 dynamic/dof yes

thermo_style    custom step atoms temp c_1 c_2 press
thermo_modify   format float %.15g lost ignore
compute_modify  thermo_temp dynamic/dof yes
thermo          100

run             800

fix_modify      20 move * rotate 0 0 0 0 0 1 25
run             400

fix_modify      20 move * none
run             100
